{
    "title": "Wood Block Doku - Puzzle Game",
    "description": "<b>Wood Block Puzzle</b> (Wood Block Doku) is an addicting Classic Block Puzzle Game that challenges you to fit blocks into a 9x9 99 Sudoku grid. \"Wood Block Puzzle\" has many logic puzzle games to play that are relaxing yet challenging. Play every day to test your IQ with classic block puzzles with no time limit gameplay and fun cube block blast levels.\r\n\r\nWood Block Puzzle Game has unlimited gameplay, play as long as you can place blocks in the Sudoku grid. There are many tetris-like blocks and woodoku styled blocks with unique and fun shapes, experience all of addicting wooden qblock puzzle games with Sudoku 99 grid rules.\r\n \r\nWood Block Puzzle Game is user-friendly for mobile and tablet devices, the interface is clean and optimized for all ages, adults and seniors. Go Offline or Online and enjoy block puzzle games anywhere!\r\n\r\n<b>Features of Wood Block Doku Game:</b>\r\n* Relaxing graphics with beautiful backgrounds\r\n* Enjoy brain logic puzzles in Portrait or Landscape\r\n* Realistic woody tile design\r\n* Jigsaw mode to fit in wooden blocks\r\n* Play offline with no-wifi\r\n* It is all FREE and No Wifi needed\r\n* Enjoy Woody Puzzle Block Blast Fun anywhere\r\n\r\nClassic Wood Block Puzzle Mode: Drag, Drop, and Blast Your Way to Greatness!\r\nImmersive Gem Block Mode allows  you to collect jewels in rows/columns to become the Block Puzzle Master!\r\n\r\nJoin the Block Puzzle Games Community: Relax, Unwind, and Level Up Your Brain!\r\n\r\nPlease Enjoy this Block Puzzle Game! \r\nIf you like games like woodoku, blockudoku, block blast, woody, wood block puzzle you will love Wood Block Doku!\r\n\r\nShare your suggestions and ideas with us to make the game even better! contact@blockpuzzlegamesinc.com\r\n\r\nFrom the creators of Block Puzzle, Block Puzzle Games.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Wood Block Puzzle</b> (Wood Block Doku) is an addicting Classic Block Puzzle Game that challenges you to fit blocks into a 9x9 99 Sudoku grid. &quot;Wood Block Puzzle&quot; has many logic puzzle games to play that are relaxing yet challenging. Play every day to test your IQ with classic block puzzles with no time limit gameplay and fun cube block blast levels.<br><br>Wood Block Puzzle Game has unlimited gameplay, play as long as you can place blocks in the Sudoku grid. There are many tetris-like blocks and woodoku styled blocks with unique and fun shapes, experience all of addicting wooden qblock puzzle games with Sudoku 99 grid rules.<br> <br>Wood Block Puzzle Game is user-friendly for mobile and tablet devices, the interface is clean and optimized for all ages, adults and seniors. Go Offline or Online and enjoy block puzzle games anywhere!<br><br><b>Features of Wood Block Doku Game:</b><br>* Relaxing graphics with beautiful backgrounds<br>* Enjoy brain logic puzzles in Portrait or Landscape<br>* Realistic woody tile design<br>* Jigsaw mode to fit in wooden blocks<br>* Play offline with no-wifi<br>* It is all FREE and No Wifi needed<br>* Enjoy Woody Puzzle Block Blast Fun anywhere<br><br>Classic Wood Block Puzzle Mode: Drag, Drop, and Blast Your Way to Greatness!<br>Immersive Gem Block Mode allows  you to collect jewels in rows/columns to become the Block Puzzle Master!<br><br>Join the Block Puzzle Games Community: Relax, Unwind, and Level Up Your Brain!<br><br>Please Enjoy this Block Puzzle Game! <br>If you like games like woodoku, blockudoku, block blast, woody, wood block puzzle you will love Wood Block Doku!<br><br>Share your suggestions and ideas with us to make the game even better! contact@blockpuzzlegamesinc.com<br><br>From the creators of Block Puzzle, Block Puzzle Games.",
